  Search for patients with diabetes:
  curl -k -u 'fhiruser:BmI512@ccess' \
    -H 'Accept: application/fhir+json' \
    'https://lfh-fhir.eastus2.cloudapp.azure.com:9443/fhir-server/api/v4/Condition?code=73211009&_include=Condi
  tion:subject'
 
  Notes:
  - -k disables SSL verification (self-signed cert)
  - 73211009 is the SNOMED CT code for Diabetes mellitus
  - The _include=Condition:subject pulls back the referenced Patient resources along with the matching
  Conditions
  - If you just want the count of diabetes conditions, append &_summary=count and drop the _include
